    "title": "Towanda Seniors to Present Christmas Play - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago This weekend, Seniors at Towanda High School will perform “Just in the Nick of Time! (a Detective Red Mistletoe Mystery),” a comical Christmas play by Linda Daugherty. In this upcoming production, Santa Claus goes missing from the North Pole, but luckily, Detective Red Mistletoe is on the case! Find out how he’ll solve the mystery on Friday, November 14th, and Saturday, November 15th, at 6:30pm. Donations will be accepted at the door. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
